### dialog.showMessageBox via ipcMain.handle

Source: https://github.com/electron/electron/blob/main/docs/fiddles/native-ui/dialogs/information-dialog/main.js

Main process handler that opens a native message box dialog and returns the user's button selection to the renderer via the invoke/handle IPC pattern

```javascript
ipcMain.handle('open-information-dialog', async () => {
  const options = {
    type: 'info',
    title: 'Information',
    message: "This is an information dialog. Isn't it nice?",
    buttons: ['Yes', 'No']
  }
  return (await dialog.showMessageBox(options)).response
})
```

