### Secure IPC bridge via contextBridge

Source: https://github.com/electron/electron/blob/main/docs/fiddles/native-ui/dialogs/information-dialog/preload.js

Preload script that securely exposes a typed API surface to the renderer using contextBridge and ipcRenderer.invoke, preventing direct access to Node.js or Electron internals

```javascript
const { contextBridge, ipcRenderer } = require('electron/renderer')

contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld('electronAPI', {
  openInformationDialog: () => ipcRenderer.invoke('open-information-dialog')
})
```
